- **Test Runner:** Vitest 4.1.7 (Vite-native)
- **DOM Environment:** jsdom
- **React Testing:** @testing-library/react 16.3.2
- **Setup File:** `/src/test-setup.ts` (imports jest-dom matchers)
- **Test Files:** `formToYaml.test.ts` (form → YAML conversion)

