### 10. **API Routes** (from axios client)

```
POST   /api/auth/login              - Login with username/password
POST   /api/auth/logout             - Logout
GET    /api/policies                - List all policies
GET    /api/policies/:name          - Get single policy
POST   /api/policies                - Create policy
PUT    /api/policies/:name          - Update policy
DELETE /api/policies/:name          - Delete policy
POST   /api/policies/preview        - Preview form as YAML
GET    /api/mode                    - Get current mode (Monitoring/Protect)
PUT    /api/mode                    - Set mode
GET    /api/namespaces              - List K8s namespaces
```

---

### 11. **Notable Patterns**

- **Form State:** Uses Ant Design Form.useForm() with Form.useWatch() for real-time YAML preview
- **Dynamic Lists:** Form.List for repeating rule sections with add/remove
- **Error Handling:** try/catch + message.error() for user feedback
- **Loading States:** Boolean flags on buttons/forms during async operations
- **Type Safety:** Full TypeScript with strict mode
- **API Interceptor:** Auto-redirect to `/login` on 401 responses
- **Responsive Layout:** Grid system (14/10 col split on edit page)
- **Accessibility:** Ant Design built-in ARIA labels

---

This is a modern, well-structured **React + Go monorepo** for Kubernetes policy management with strong typing, comprehensive UI, and Kubernetes-native deployment."
