<p class="subtitle">選擇前端 UI 庫與架構策略</p>

<div class="cards" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">

  <!-- Approach 1: CoreUI React (Recommended) -->
  <div class="card" data-choice="coreui" onclick="toggleSelect(this)" style="border: 2px solid #2d7dd2;">
    <div class="card-image" style="background:#1b2a3b; padding:0.75rem; border-radius:6px 6px 0 0; position:relative;">
      <div style="position:absolute;top:0.4rem;right:0.4rem;background:#2d7dd2;color:#fff;font-size:0.55rem;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;">推薦</div>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:0.4rem; height:150px;">
        <div style="width:32%; background:#0f1923; border-radius:4px; padding:0.4rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.25rem;">
          <div style="background:#2d7dd2; height:5px; border-radius:2px;"></div>
          <div style="height:3px;"></div>
          <div style="background:#ffffff33; height:3px; border-radius:2px;"></div>
          <div style="background:#2d7dd2; height:3px; border-radius:2px; padding-left:6px;"></div>
          <div style="background:#ffffff22; height:3px; border-radius:2px; margin-left:6px;"></div>
          <div style="background:#ffffff22; height:3px; border-radius:2px; margin-left:6px;"></div>
          <div style="background:#ffffff33; height:3px; border-radius:2px;"></div>
          <div style="background:#ffffff22; height:3px; border-radius:2px;"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex:1; background:#f5f6fa; border-radius:4px; padding:0.4rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.3rem;">
          <div style="background:#e0e3eb; border-radius:3px; height:8px; width:60%;"></div>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:0.2rem;">
            <div style="background:#2d7dd2; border-radius:3px; height:18px; flex:1;"></div>
            <div style="background:#28a745; border-radius:3px; height:18px; flex:1;"></div>
            <div style="background:#dc3545; border-radius:3px; height:18px; flex:1;"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:#ffffff; border-radius:3px; flex:1; border:1px solid #dee2e6;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3>方案 A — CoreUI React <span style="font-size:0.7rem;color:#6c757d;">(@coreui/react)</span></h3>
      <div class="pros-cons" style="margin-top:0.5rem;">
        <div class="pros">
          <h4>優點</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>與 NeuVector 最接近，CSSidebar 多層導覽開箱即用</li>
            <li>深色 Sidebar + 淺色 Content 主題內建</li>
            <li>Bootstrap 5 CSS 加持，表格/表單樣式一致</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="cons">
          <h4>缺點</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>需完整替換 Ant Design 所有元件</li>
            <li>多一個 @coreui 依賴</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Approach 2: React-Bootstrap custom -->
  <div class="card" data-choice="react-bootstrap" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="card-image" style="background:#1b2a3b; padding:0.75rem; border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;">
      <div style="display:flex; gap:0.4rem; height:150px;">
        <div style="width:32%; background:#0f1923; border-radius:4px; padding:0.4rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.25rem;">
