          <div style="height:3px;"></div>
          <div style="background:#ffffff33; height:3px; border-radius:2px;"></div>
          <div style="background:#ffffff33; height:3px; border-radius:2px;"></div>
          <div style="background:#ffffff22; height:3px; border-radius:2px;"></div>
          <div style="background:#ffffff22; height:3px; border-radius:2px;"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="flex:1; background:#f5f6fa; border-radius:4px; padding:0.4rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.3rem;">
          <div style="background:#e0e3eb; border-radius:3px; height:8px; width:60%;"></div>
          <div style="background:#ffffff; border-radius:3px; flex:1; border:1px solid #dee2e6;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3>方案 B — React-Bootstrap 自建</h3>
      <div class="pros-cons" style="margin-top:0.5rem;">
        <div class="pros">
          <h4>優點</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>依賴最輕，只有 react-bootstrap + bootstrap CSS</li>
            <li>Sidebar/Header 完全自訂，無框架限制</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="cons">
          <h4>缺點</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Sidebar collapse、多層選單需自行實作</li>
            <li>實作時間較長，視覺一致性靠自己維持</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Approach 3: Hybrid -->
  <div class="card" data-choice="hybrid" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="card-image" style="background:#1b2a3b; padding:0.75rem; border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;">
      <div style="display:flex; gap:0.4rem; height:150px;">
        <div style="width:32%; background:#0f1923; border-radius:4px; padding:0.4rem; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0.25rem;">
